OL,3,AI've been to Gamescom six times -
OL,4,Ahere's what excited me this year
OL,5,
OL,6,FGamescom is the largest in-person
OL,7,Fgaming event in the world, and this
OL,8,Fyear it lived up to expectations with
OL,9,Fbig games on show from The Witcher 3's
OL,10,Fnew expansion, to Alien: Isolation 2.
OL,12,FLast year over 350,000 people flocked
OL,13,Fto the halls of the Koelnmesse in
OL,14,FCologne, Germany to get a chance to see
OL,15,Fand play the most hotly anticipated
OL,16,Fgames.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
